schema: "0.4"
id: npl-editorial-31-artifacts-list
type: image
quality: high

# NoizuPromptLingo — an org-scoped index of artifacts produced by work sessions — Artifacts List screen.
# Theme tenets: warm paper stock, serif body (Source Serif 4), single muted-claret ink accent, near-square 2px radius, warm beige hairline rules, airy catalog density.
# Palette: paper #fbf8f1, warm ink #1c1917, claret #9a2c3f, petrol #1d4e5f, beige hairline #e3d9c6.

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior product designer rendering a high-fidelity UI mockup of a
    catalog/index page that reads like the contents pages of a printed reference —
    calm, literate, unhurried. The body face is a SERIF; the canvas is warm off-white
    paper; margins are generous and rows breathe. This is NOT a dense cool-white SaaS
    grid and NOT a dark console. A table here separates rows with warm beige hairline
    rules only — no vertical grid lines, no zebra fill, no boxed cards or drop
    shadows.
  text: |
    A 16:9 high-fidelity UI mockup of the Artifacts List screen of NoizuPromptLingo,
    an organization-scoped index of artifacts produced by work sessions. It reads
    like a catalog page in a printed reference, not a dense SaaS grid.

    OVERALL LAYOUT (a single dominant CENTER column on a warm off-white paper canvas
    with wide margins, plus an optional slim LEFT nav rail): bands separated by warm
    beige hairline rules and generous whitespace.

    TOP HEADER BAND: serif wordmark "NPL" at left; a page title "Artifacts" as a serif
    H1; a "Create Artifact" typeset label-button filled muted claret at right.

    FILTER ROW (below the title, above the table): a SESSION FILTER CHIP shown as a
    small warm-paper pill on a beige hairline with near-square corners and a monospace
    session slug (for example "#session-4f2a"), plus a subtle "clear" affordance; a
    warm-gray result count in serif to its right ("18 artifacts").

    CENTER ARTIFACT TABLE (dominant): a calm, airy table with generous row height and
    warm beige hairline row rules only — no vertical grid lines, no zebra fill, no
    boxed card. Columns: an ARTIFACT TYPE ICON (a small line glyph — document, code,
    spec), NAME in serif, TYPE as a small serif small-caps label, OWNING SESSION as a
    monospace slug, and LAST REVISED as a warm-gray monospace timestamp right-aligned.
    Show about eight rows of plausible artifact names. The header row is serif
    small-caps with a slightly heavier beige rule beneath it. One row shows a faint
    warm hover tone with the name underlined in petrol.

    PALETTE & TYPE: warm off-white paper, warm near-black serif ink, one muted claret
    accent (the Create button), deep petrol teal for the hovered/linked name,
    warm-gray for meta text. Warm beige hairlines throughout, never cool gray. Serif
    (Source Serif 4) for names, titles, and labels; monospace only for session slugs
    and timestamps. No geometric sans.

    SHAPE & SURFACE: near-square 2px corners on the button and chip, flat and tonal,
    separation by hairline rules and margin rather than shadow or fill; a faint paper
    grain on the canvas.

    MOOD: considered, literate, unhurried — an index you read, like the contents pages
    of a well-set standard.
  negative: "watermark, signature, lorem ipsum placeholder text, low-fidelity wireframe, monitor/device photograph framing, blurry, distorted UI"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    relevance: {weight: 3, description: "Shows an artifact table (type icon, name, type, owning session, last-revised), a session filter chip, and a create-artifact action"}
    theme_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Warm paper canvas, serif type, single muted-claret accent, petrol links, hairline-only table rules, near-square 2px radius — not a dense cool-white grid"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Clear visual hierarchy, airy catalog density, plausible list layout"}
    technical: {weight: 2, description: "Sharp, correct 16:9 aspect, no artifacts"}
  reject_if:
    - "lorem ipsum or placeholder text visible"
    - "watermark or signature visible"
    - "wireframe-level fidelity instead of high-fidelity mockup"

tags: [npl-editorial, NoizuPromptLingo, screen-mockup]
